  description: "Produce AORG-SETTLEMENT2-ANALYST-DRAFT-001 on the first line and one short validation sentence. Then formally call submit_task_result with that output; do not stop at ordinary assistant text. The reviewer will request one revision. If revision feedback arrives, change the first line to AORG-SETTLEMENT2-ANALYST-REVISED-001 and formally resubmit the same task."
});
text(r);

